HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ffssyynncc() system call appeared in 4.2BSD.  The ffddaattaassyynncc() system call
     appeared in FreeBSD 11.1.

BBUUGGSS
     The ffddaattaassyynncc() system call currently does not guarantee that enqueued
     aio(4) requests for the file referenced by _f_d are completed before the
     syscall returns.

